<title>UK: T.J. Hughes says Dec '96 sales meet target.</title>
<headline>T.J. Hughes says Dec '96 sales meet target.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Department store operator T.J. Hughes Plc said on Thursday that it achieved its expected sales on both like-for-like and overall bases in December 1996.</p>
<p>&quot;All departments contributed to the improvement in turnover,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said trading continued to be buoyant so far in January despite the cold weather. Hughes operates department stores in north west of England.</p>
<p>The company said it planned to open a new full line store at Rochdale next March.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
